  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring Progress of the Environmental Cooperation Agenda in the CAFTA-DR Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this cooperative agreement is to increase public participation in enforcement of environmental laws in Central America and to.enable the Secretariat for Environmental Matters (SEM) to perform the functions established for it under Articles 17.7 and 17.8 of CAFTA-DR.</narrative>
  </description>
